#: pages/page-mainwp-post.php:2103
msgid "Create a new bulk page. Scheduling pages on Child Sites is almost the same as publishing it. The only difference is before clicking the Publish button is setting it to Scheduled status and setting the time. For additional help, please check this %1$shelp documentation%2$s."
msgstr "建立一個新的批次頁面。在子網站上安排頁面幾乎與釋出頁面相同。唯一的區別是在單擊“釋出”按鈕之前將其設定為“已計劃”狀態並設定時間。如需其他幫助，請檢視此%1$s幫助文件%2$s。"

#: pages/page-mainwp-post.php:2101
msgid "Create a new bulk post. Scheduling posts on Child Sites is almost the same as publishing it. The only difference is before clicking the Publish button is setting it to Scheduled status and setting the time. For additional help, please check this %1$shelp documentation%2$s."
msgstr "建立新的批次文章。與在子網站定時釋出文章幾乎相同。唯一的區別是在單擊“釋出”按鈕之前將其設定為“已計劃”狀態並設定時間。如需其他幫助，請檢視此%1$s幫助文件%2$s。"

